Interactability_Text_Line_0 I took the money... I always took the money, always <i> take</i> the money.<br>I let them get away with murdering their own son, he was so young.- Why, why, why! How can they act like nothing happened, what’s wrong with them!? What’s wrong with me! To get tricked like that, I’m supposed to be better than this! Why, why, why!